BT /F1 10 Tf 72 690 Td (Lumen Notes is a made-up note-taking app, used in lesson 4.1. Every fact below is invented,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 676 Td (so a model can only know it by reading this text.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 650 Td (Accounts and sign-up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 630 Td (You can sign up with an email address or with a Google account. A new account starts on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 616 Td (Free plan. We send a conÄrmation email right after sign-up; the conÄrmation link works for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 602 Td (48†hours. If it runs out, open the app and choose "Resend conÄrmation" on the welcome) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 588 Td (screen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 568 Td (One email address can have only one Lumen Notes account. To move notes from one account to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 554 Td (another, export them from the old account and import them in the new one \(see "Export and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 540 Td (import"\). Usernames can be changed once every 30†days from Settings > ProÄle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 520 Td (Children under 13†may not create an account. School accounts are created by a teacher) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 506 Td (through Lumen Classroom, which is a separate product with its own handbook.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 480 Td (Passwords and sign-in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 460 Td (Passwords must be at least 10†characters long and contain at least one number. To reset a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 446 Td (password, click "Forgot password" on the sign-in page and enter your email address. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 432 Td (reset link we send expires after 15†minutes and can be used only once. If you ask for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 418 Td (several links, only the newest one works.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 398 Td (After 5†wrong passwords in a row, the account is locked for 30†minutes. The lock ends by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 384 Td (itself; support cannot unlock it sooner. Signing in with Google does not use a Lumen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 370 Td (password at all, so the lock does not apply to it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 344 Td (Two-step sign-in) Tj ET
