BT /F1 8 Tf 72 740 Td (Lumen Notes - Support Handbook \(internal\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 690 Td (Two-step sign-in adds a 6-digit code from an authenticator app. Turn it on in Settings >) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 676 Td (Security. When you turn it on, you get 8†backup codes. Each backup code works once. Keep) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 662 Td (them somewhere safe, for example printed on paper.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 642 Td (If you lose your phone and your backup codes, support can turn two-step sign-in off, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 628 Td (only after an identity check: you answer questions about your account and wait 72†hours. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 614 Td (wait is there so a stranger cannot take over an account quickly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 588 Td (Plans and prices) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 568 Td (There are three plans. Free: 3†notebooks, 2 GB of storage, sync on 2†devices. Plus:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 554 Td (unlimited notebooks, 50 GB of storage, sync on any number of devices, 6†euros per month or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 540 Td (60†euros per year. Team: everything in Plus, plus shared notebooks and admin controls,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 526 Td (9†euros per person per month, with a minimum of 3†people.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 506 Td (Prices include VAT for customers in the European Union. Students with a school email address) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 492 Td (get 40†percent off Plus. The discount is checked again every 12†months.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 466 Td (Billing and invoices) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 446 Td (We charge the card on the same day of the month that you Ärst upgraded. If you upgraded on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 432 Td (the 31st, months with fewer days are charged on their last day. Invoices are sent by email) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 418 Td (as PDF Äles within one hour of each payment. Old invoices are also listed in Settings >) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 404 Td (Billing > History.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 384 Td (We accept Visa, Mastercard and PayPal. Bank transfer is possible only for Team plans with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 370 Td (20†or more people. If a payment fails, we try again after 3†days and after 7†days. After the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 356 Td (third failed try, the account moves back to the Free plan, and notes over the Free limits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 342 Td (become read-only. Nothing is deleted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 281 42 Td (Page 2 of 6) Tj ET
