BT /F1 10 Tf 72 664 Td (You can ask for a full refund within 14†days of a payment. After 14†days we do not refund,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 650 Td (but you can cancel so the next payment does not happen. Refunds go back to the card or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 636 Td (PayPal account that paid, and take 5†to 10†working days to arrive. Yearly plans cancelled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 622 Td (after the 14†days keep their features until the end of the paid year.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 602 Td (Refunds are handled by the billing team, not by Ärst-line support. Write to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 588 Td (billing@lumen.example with your invoice number.) Tj ET
