BT /F1 10 Tf 72 542 Td (Each attachment can be at most 200 MB. Images inside notes are shrunk to a width of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 528 Td (2000†pixels unless "Keep original images" is on. Audio recordings are saved as M4A Äles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 514 Td (Deleted notes stay in the Trash for 30†days; after that they are gone for good and support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 500 Td (cannot bring them back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 480 Td (When an account is over its storage limit, you can still read and edit existing notes, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 466 Td (you cannot add new attachments.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 440 Td (Sync) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 420 Td (Sync runs every 60†seconds while the app is open, and right away when you press the sync) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 406 Td (button. If the same note was changed on two devices while one was ofÅine, both versions are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 392 Td (kept: the second one is saved as a copy with "\(conÅict\)" in its title. Nothing is merged) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 378 Td (automatically.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 358 Td (Sync needs app version 7.2†or newer. Older versions can still open notes on the device but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 344 Td (stop syncing.) Tj ET
