BT /F1 10 Tf 72 616 Td (Import works from Markdown Äles, from plain text Äles and from ENEX Äles made by other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 602 Td (note apps. Tags in ENEX Äles are kept. Import does not bring over comments or edit history.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 576 Td (Sharing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 556 Td (Any note can be shared as a read-only web link. Links can have a password and an end date.) Tj ET
